        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Diciptakan oleh Evan You pada tahun 2014, Vue menggabungkan bagian-bagian terbaik dari AngularJS (template directives) dan React (Virtual DOM & komponen reaktif).</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-3 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code text-success me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Materi:</h6>\n    <ul class=\"mb-0 small\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        <li>Deklaratif vs Imperatif: Alih-alih memanipulasi elemen DOM satu per satu dengan <code>document.getElementById</code>, Anda hanya mendefinisikan hubungan antara data dan tampilan.</li><li>Performa Tinggi: Core Vue 3 berukuran sangat ringan (~16KB gzipped) dengan algoritma compiler-informed Virtual DOM yang cepat.</li><li>Dua Gaya API: Mendukung Options API (pemula & terstruktur) dan Composition API (fleksibilitas logika skala enterprise).</li>\n    </ul>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Deklaratif Counter Rendering",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: #f8fafc;\n            color: #1e293b;\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .vue-app-container {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 24px;\n            max-width: 520px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n            border-top: 4px solid #42b883;\n        }\n        .vue-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n        }\n        .vue-title {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #0d2e5c;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n        .badge-vue {\n            background: #42b883;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 3px 10px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n        button {\n            background: #42b883;\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            transition: all 0.2s;\n        }\n        button:hover {\n            background: #33a06f;\n        }\n        input, select, textarea {\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            outline: none;\n        }\n        input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {\n            border-color: #42b883;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(66, 184, 131, 0.15);\n        }\n        .pill {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #e2e8f0;\n            padding: 4px 10px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            margin: 2px;\n        }\n        \n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app\" class=\"vue-app-container\">\n        <div class=\"vue-header\">\n            <span class=\"vue-title\">🟢 Vue Intro</span>\n            <span class=\"badge-vue\">Vue 3 Live</span>\n        </div>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:0;\"><strong>Arsitektur Model-View:</strong></p>\n<div style=\"background:#f1f5f9; padding:12px; border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:12px;\">\n    Nilai Counter: <span style=\"font-weight:bold; color:#42b883; font-size:20px;\">{{ hitungan }}</span>\n</div>\n<button @click=\"hitungan++\">+ Tambah Counter</button>\n<button @click=\"hitungan = 0\" style=\"background:#94a3b8; margin-left:6px;\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const { createApp, ref, reactive, computed, watch, onMounted } = Vue;\n        createApp({\n    data() {\n        return {\n            hitungan: 0\n        };\n    }\n}).mount('#app');\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<div class=\"mt-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info text-success me-2\"></i>Penjelasan Kode & Reaktivitas:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small text-secondary mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">Tidak ada kode <code>innerText = hitungan</code> manual; manipulasi <code>hitungan++</code> langsung terefleksi berkat two-way reactivity engine.</p>\n</div>"
