      "vue_server": {
        "title": "Vue Server",
        "summary": "Pengenalan Server-Side Rendering (SSR) dan SSG dengan Nuxt 3: Meningkatkan performa SEO dan proses Client Hydration.",
        "content": "<p class=\"lead\">Server-Side Rendering (SSR) adalah teknik di mana kode Vue dikompilasi menjadi dokumen HTML utuh di sisi server sebelum dikirimkan ke browser pengguna.</p>\n<div class=\"card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-3 rounded-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy mb-2\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-code text-success me-2\"></i>Konsep Kunci Materi:</h6>\n    <ul class=\"mb-0 small\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">\n        <li>Manfaat Utama SEO: Mesin pencari (seperti Googlebot) dapat langsung mengindeks seluruh konten teks tanpa harus menunggu JavaScript selesai dimuat.</li><li>Waktu Muat Pertama Cepat (First Contentful Paint): Pengguna langsung melihat tampilan halaman secara instan di jaringan lambat.</li><li>Nuxt 3 Framework: Framework resmi paling populer untuk membangun aplikasi Vue SSR dan Fullstack modern.</li>\n    </ul>\n</div>",
        "example_title": "Konsep Vue Server-Side Rendering (SSR)",
        "example_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"></script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: #f8fafc;\n            color: #1e293b;\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .vue-app-container {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 24px;\n            max-width: 520px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n            border-top: 4px solid #42b883;\n        }\n        .vue-header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\n        }\n        .vue-title {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #0d2e5c;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n        .badge-vue {\n            background: #42b883;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 3px 10px;\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n        button {\n            background: #42b883;\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 8px 16px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            transition: all 0.2s;\n        }\n        button:hover {\n            background: #33a06f;\n        }\n        input, select, textarea {\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            outline: none;\n        }\n        input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {\n            border-color: #42b883;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(66, 184, 131, 0.15);\n        }\n        .pill {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #e2e8f0;\n            padding: 4px 10px;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            margin: 2px;\n        }\n        \n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app\" class=\"vue-app-container\">\n        <div class=\"vue-header\">\n            <span class=\"vue-title\">🟢 Vue Server</span>\n            <span class=\"badge-vue\">Vue 3 Live</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#0f172a; color:#f8fafc; padding:16px; border-radius:8px; font-family:monospace; font-size:13px; line-height:1.7;\">\n<span style=\"color:#38bdf8;\">// Nuxt 3 & Server-Side Rendering (SSR):</span><br>\n1. <strong>Server-Side Rendering (SSR)</strong>: HTML dirender di server untuk SEO optimal<br>\n2. <strong>Hydration</strong>: Vue menyambungkan reaktivitas ke HTML statis di browser<br>\n3. <strong>Static Site Generation (SSG)</strong>: Kompilasi halaman HTML statis di muka<br>\n<span style=\"color:#42b883;\">Ekosistem Utama: Nuxt.js (Framework Fullstack Resmi Vue)</span>\n</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        const { createApp, ref, reactive, computed, watch, onMounted } = Vue;\n        createApp({}).mount('#app');\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "explanation": "<div class=\"mt-3\">\n    <h6 class=\"fw-bold text-navy\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-info text-success me-2\"></i>Penjelasan Kode & Reaktivitas:</h6>\n    <p class=\"small text-secondary mb-0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">SSR memadukan keunggulan kecepatan render server dengan interaktivitas halus Client Hydration di peramban pengguna.</p>\n</div>"
      }
